        <summary>What is a Star Battle puzzle?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">Star Battle is a logic puzzle where you place stars on a grid divided into shaded regions. Every row, every column and every region must contain exactly 2 stars (3 on Hard grids), and no two stars may touch — not even diagonally. GridPaw puzzles each have exactly one solution.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
