        <summary>Is this Star Battle puzzle free?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">Yes — the GridPaw Star Battle puzzle is completely free in your browser. No download, no account, no payment. Pick Easy 8×8, Medium 10×10 or Hard 14×14 and start placing stars immediately.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
